な-adjective＋な＋一方（で）
Noun＋である＋一方（で）') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'〜一方（で） contrasts two sides of a situation that hold at the same time — ''on one hand…, while on the other…''. 明るい一方で = cheerful, while (on the other hand)…. It links two coexisting facts that pull in different directions, often about the same person or thing.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'〜一方（で） contrasts two sides of a situation that hold at the same time — ''on one hand…, while on the other…''. 明るい一方で = cheerful, while (on the other hand)…. It links two coexisting facts that pull in different directions, often about the same person or thing.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'一方で sets up a contrast between two coexisting sides; don''t mix it up with 一方だ (''keeps ~ing more and more'').
The two sides usually pull in opposite directions, so it is not just neutral addition.' AND DATALENGTH(c.UsageNotes) = DATALENGTH(N'一方で sets up a contrast between two coexisting sides; don''t mix it up with 一方だ (''keeps ~ing more and more'').
