BEGIN
UPDATE c SET Meaning = N'Chỉ, kể từ đó không còn', Formation = N'Số lượng ＋ きり／động từ thể た ＋ きり', Explanation = N'Sau thể た, nêu việc xảy ra một lần rồi không lặp lại hoặc trạng thái tiếp diễn từ đó.', UsageNotes = NULL, UpdatedAt = SYSUTCDATETIME()
FROM Grammars c WHERE c.Id = @Id AND c.Meaning COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'only; just; (after た-form) ~ and nothing since' AND DATALENGTH(c.Meaning) = DATALENGTH(N'only; just; (after た-form) ~ and nothing since') AND c.Formation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'Noun ＋ きり
Verb［た form］＋ きり' AND DATALENGTH(c.Formation) = DATALENGTH(N'Noun ＋ きり
Verb［た form］＋ きり') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'きり has two senses: after a noun it means ''only, just'' (二人きり = just the two of us), and after a た-form verb it means ''since ~, and nothing has changed since'' (出かけたきり = went out and hasn''t come back). Both narrow things down to a single case.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'きり has two senses: after a noun it means ''only, just'' (二人きり = just the two of us), and after a た-form verb it means ''since ~, and nothing has changed since'' (出かけたきり = went out and hasn''t come back). Both narrow things down to a single case.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'With a た-form it implies the expected next action never followed: 寝たきり = bedridden (lay down and stayed that way).
In the ''only'' sense it overlaps with だけ but feels more exclusive and is a bit colloquial.' AND DATALENGTH(c.UsageNotes) = DATALENGTH(N'With a た-form it implies the expected next action never followed: 寝たきり = bedridden (lay down and stayed that way).
In the ''only'' sense it overlaps with だけ but feels more exclusive and is a bit colloquial.');
