Noun ＋ の ＋ くせに
な-adjective ＋ な ＋ くせに') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'〜くせに means ''even though'', but always with a critical, reproachful edge — you are blaming or looking down on someone for the contradiction. 知っているくせに教えてくれない = he won''t tell me even though he knows. Both clauses usually share the same subject.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'〜くせに means ''even though'', but always with a critical, reproachful edge — you are blaming or looking down on someone for the contradiction. 知っているくせに教えてくれない = he won''t tell me even though he knows. Both clauses usually share the same subject.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'It carries blame or contempt, so it is rude toward the person described; for a neutral ''even though'', use のに.
