Verb／adjective［plain form］＋ せいで') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'せいで pins a bad outcome on a cause — "because of ~, (something unwanted happened)." 電車が遅れたせいで、遅刻した = I was late because the train was delayed. The result is undesirable, and せいで often assigns fault. Its positive-outcome counterpart is おかげで.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'せいで pins a bad outcome on a cause — "because of ~, (something unwanted happened)." 電車が遅れたせいで、遅刻した = I was late because the train was delayed. The result is undesirable, and せいで often assigns fault. Its positive-outcome counterpart is おかげで.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'せいで is for unwanted results and often assigns blame; for a welcome result, use おかげで.
