Noun ＋ と違って ＋ Sentence') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'This pair sets up a comparison as the background to a statement. Noun ＋ と同じで means ''just like ~, (so) ...'' — 兄と同じで、私も甘いものが好きだ = like my brother, I love sweets too. Noun ＋ と違って means ''unlike ~, ...'' — 去年と違って、今年は涼しい = unlike last year, this year is cool. The first half names what you compare with; the main point comes after.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'This pair sets up a comparison as the background to a statement. Noun ＋ と同じで means ''just like ~, (so) ...'' — 兄と同じで、私も甘いものが好きだ = like my brother, I love sweets too. Noun ＋ と違って means ''unlike ~, ...'' — 去年と違って、今年は涼しい = unlike last year, this year is cool. The first half names what you compare with; the main point comes after.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'The compared thing takes と: 兄と違って, not 兄に違って.
