い-adjective［stem］＋ くないことはない' AND DATALENGTH(c.Formation) = DATALENGTH(N'Verb［ない form］＋ ことはない
い-adjective［stem］＋ くないことはない') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'This double negative softly affirms that something is possible after all — 急げば間に合わないことはない = it''s not impossible to make it if we hurry. It admits the possibility while holding back full enthusiasm, so it often carries a reluctant or hedged tone. Attach ことはない to a verb''s ない form, or to 〜くない for adjectives.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'This double negative softly affirms that something is possible after all — 急げば間に合わないことはない = it''s not impossible to make it if we hurry. It admits the possibility while holding back full enthusiasm, so it often carries a reluctant or hedged tone. Attach ことはない to a verb''s ない form, or to 〜くない for adjectives.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'It''s a soft, hedged ''yes, it''s possible'', weaker than a plain affirmative — often with unspoken reluctance.
