Noun ＋ についての ＋ Noun') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'について marks the topic you speak, write, or think about — ''about / concerning ~''. この町の歴史について調べる (''research about this town''s history''). Before a noun, add の — その問題についての意見 (''an opinion about that problem''). It is the everyday way to name a subject.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'について marks the topic you speak, write, or think about — ''about / concerning ~''. この町の歴史について調べる (''research about this town''s history''). Before a noun, add の — その問題についての意見 (''an opinion about that problem''). It is the everyday way to name a subject.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'Add の to modify a noun: 事故についての説明, not 事故について説明.
