Noun ＋ による ＋ Noun') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'によって has several linked uses: means or method (話し合いによって解決する = solve through discussion), cause (地震によって = due to the earthquake), the agent in a passive sentence (学生によって作られた = made by a student), and variation (人によって違う = differs from person to person). The prenominal form is による (事故による遅れ). Context tells you which sense is meant.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'によって has several linked uses: means or method (話し合いによって解決する = solve through discussion), cause (地震によって = due to the earthquake), the agent in a passive sentence (学生によって作られた = made by a student), and variation (人によって違う = differs from person to person). The prenominal form is による (事故による遅れ). Context tells you which sense is meant.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'In a passive sentence with a clear doer — especially create/discover verbs — the agent takes によって: この寺は昔の人々によって建てられた.
''X によって違う／変わる'' means something varies depending on X; do not read that as ''caused by X''.
Before a noun, use による, not によって: 雨による中止.' AND DATALENGTH(c.UsageNotes) = DATALENGTH(N'In a passive sentence with a clear doer — especially create/discover verbs — the agent takes によって: この寺は昔の人々によって建てられた.
''X によって違う／変わる'' means something varies depending on X; do not read that as ''caused by X''.
Before a noun, use による, not によって: 雨による中止.');
