A second nuance is defiance/determination: 絶対に勝ってやる = ''I''ll definitely win — just watch me''.' AND DATALENGTH(c.UsageNotes) = DATALENGTH(N'The register is blunt. Toward equals or superiors use てあげる, not てやる.
It''s common with juniors and pets/plants: 弟に教えてやる, 犬にえさをやる.
