Noun ＋ の ＋ まま
な-adjective ＋ な ＋ まま' AND DATALENGTH(c.Formation) = DATALENGTH(N'Verb［た form］＋ まま
Verb［ない form］＋ まま
Noun ＋ の ＋ まま
な-adjective ＋ な ＋ まま') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'まま describes a state left unchanged while something else happens — ''as it is / still in that condition''. Something stays the way it was instead of being set right: 窓を開けたまま出かけた (went out with the window left open). It attaches to た form, ない form, な-adjective＋な, or noun＋の.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'まま describes a state left unchanged while something else happens — ''as it is / still in that condition''. Something stays the way it was instead of being set right: 窓を開けたまま出かけた (went out with the window left open). It attaches to た form, ない form, な-adjective＋な, or noun＋の.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'The state carries over into the next action: 靴をはいたまま入る (enter with shoes still on).
