Mark the receiver with に and the thing with を — 友だち に 花 を あげる.' AND DATALENGTH(c.UsageNotes) = DATALENGTH(N'The direction is fixed: あげる sends the gift away from the speaker. If it comes toward you or your in-group, switch to くれる.
Mark the receiver with に and the thing with を — 友だち に 花 を あげる.');
