The place of existence takes に (公園に), and the thing that exists takes が (トイレがある).' AND DATALENGTH(c.UsageNotes) = DATALENGTH(N'Choose by animacy, not by the English ''have'': use ある for things and plants, いる for people and animals — 木がある but 犬がいる.
