FROM Grammars c WHERE c.Id = @Id AND c.Meaning COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'why; how come (casual)' AND DATALENGTH(c.Meaning) = DATALENGTH(N'why; how come (casual)') AND c.Formation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'なんで ＋ Sentence ＋ の ／ か' AND DATALENGTH(c.Formation) = DATALENGTH(N'なんで ＋ Sentence ＋ の ／ か') AND c.Explanation COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'Asks "why" in a casual, conversational way. It means the same as どうして and なぜ but sounds the most relaxed, so it fits chatting with friends and family rather than formal writing or business speech.' AND DATALENGTH(c.Explanation) = DATALENGTH(N'Asks "why" in a casual, conversational way. It means the same as どうして and なぜ but sounds the most relaxed, so it fits chatting with friends and family rather than formal writing or business speech.') AND c.UsageNotes COLLATE Latin1_General_100_BIN2 = N'Written 何で, it can also mean ''by what means'' (どうやって); context usually makes ''why'' clear, but the double sense can trip readers up.
